sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as Streamlit app.py
    participant Syllabus as syllabus_agent
    participant Research as research_agent
    participant Notes as notes_agent
    participant Importance as importance_agent
    participant Questions as question_agent
    participant PDF as pdf_generator
    participant LLM as LM Studio (OpenAI API)

    User->>UI: Enter subject + topics + mode
    UI->>Syllabus: analyze_syllabus(subject, units)
    Syllabus->>LLM: prompt
    LLM-->>Syllabus: topics
    Syllabus-->>UI: topics

    UI->>Research: research_topics(topics)
    Research->>LLM: prompt
    LLM-->>Research: context
    Research-->>UI: context

    UI->>Notes: generate_notes(context, mode)
    Notes->>LLM: prompt
    LLM-->>Notes: notes
    Notes-->>UI: notes

    UI->>Importance: predict_importance(topics)
    Importance->>LLM: prompt
    LLM-->>Importance: importance output
    Importance-->>UI: importance

    UI->>Questions: generate_questions(topics)
    Questions->>LLM: prompt
    LLM-->>Questions: questions
    Questions-->>UI: questions

    UI->>PDF: create_pdf(notes, importance, questions)
    PDF-->>UI: PDF path
    UI-->>User: Tabs + PDF download
